    "message": "Improper Socket.Receive usage. Will corrupt stream if you send over 1500 bytes.\nDisconnection events were not being fired on the server.\nA single buffer was used for TCP Servers which only works on clients.\nDisconnection from occurring due to Socket.Poll\nFixed in 1.1.4.0+",
